WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:05.549
Price from usage, not from intuition, and keep price tables dated.

3
00:00:05.829 --> 00:00:10.587
Remember that output tokens, including thinking, drive both cost and latency.

4
00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:15.133
Use the tier ladder and the effort setting before reaching for a different provider.

5
00:00:15.413 --> 00:00:22.923
Read each provider’s docs for what it is built to do, read leaderboards knowing their biases, and treat both as a shortlist.

6
00:00:23.203 --> 00:00:32.035
Then decide with a small eval on your own task, and keep it so you can decide again when the landscape moves, which it will before you finish this program.
